G1 verdict fixtures assert --dump-write-frames output, which the compiler
prints during ELABORATION.  The compiled path runs `tur build` with stdout
unredirected and only captures the built binary's output, so the dump would
never reach actual.stdout; the `tur run` path this marker selects captures
both.  Nothing here is interpreter-specific -- the write-frame verdict is
computed in the elaborator, which both engines share.
